WEBVTT

00:00:00.210 --> 00:00:02.500
Hello! How are you?

00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:05.210
Welcome to Escuelita de la Tierra.

00:00:05.210 --> 00:00:10.130
We are women of the earth. women
from the outskirts.

00:00:10.130 --> 00:00:12.800
I'm Gris. And I'm Chío.

00:00:12.800 --> 00:00:18.210
We are part of the collective.
Welcome. everyone!

00:00:18.210 --> 00:00:25.610
These two spaces you can see here

00:00:25.610 --> 00:00:29.610
are the first two classrooms we're
building.

00:00:29.610 --> 00:00:35.530
The solar panels will be mounted on
top of the metal roofs.

00:00:35.530 --> 00:00:39.500
In the storage room at the back.

00:00:39.500 --> 00:00:43.010
we'll install the inverter and the
batteries.

00:00:50.610 --> 00:00:55.000
This will be our kitchen for
Mujeres de la Tierra.

00:00:55.000 --> 00:00:58.770
There will be wood-burning stoves.

00:00:58.770 --> 00:01:05.170
but we'll also need electricity for
the refrigerator

00:01:05.170 --> 00:01:09.700
and the blenders we use when we
cook.

00:01:09.700 --> 00:01:12.170
And what else?

00:01:12.170 --> 00:01:16.500
Yes. mainly the wood-burning stoves

00:01:16.500 --> 00:01:20.930
that we'll use for cooking.

00:01:20.930 --> 00:01:25.930
The solar panels are essential for
us.

00:01:25.930 --> 00:01:31.930
They would be a huge help as we get
this school project started.

00:01:31.930 --> 00:01:34.000
How many lights will you need?

00:01:34.000 --> 00:01:38.930
We'll need several lights. both
indoors and outdoors.

00:01:38.930 --> 00:01:44.930
About six lights. more or less.

00:01:44.930 --> 00:01:47.930
Yes. that's right.

00:01:47.930 --> 00:01:53.930
This is the other space for the
cooking workshop.

00:01:53.930 --> 00:01:58.000
We'll put a large table here.

00:01:58.000 --> 00:02:02.000
along with the refrigerator.

00:02:02.000 --> 00:02:07.930
electric hot plates and electric
ovens.

00:02:07.930 --> 00:02:12.000
As my colleague said. the grounds
are large.

00:02:12.000 --> 00:02:16.500
so we need outdoor lighting

00:02:16.500 --> 00:02:20.000
and security cameras.

00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:26.930
We'll also need internet access for
the cameras to work.

00:02:26.930 --> 00:02:31.930
Please come with us to the back.

00:02:37.000 --> 00:02:43.420
This is the water cistern.

00:02:43.420 --> 00:02:48.700
We'll install a water pump here

00:02:48.700 --> 00:02:54.700
to lift water up to the tank above.

00:02:54.700 --> 00:02:58.700
At the back. we also have a dry
toilet.

00:02:59.420 --> 00:03:05.000
We'll install lighting there.

00:03:05.000 --> 00:03:09.000
both outside and inside.

00:03:09.000 --> 00:03:13.420
so the dry toilet will be well lit.

00:03:14.420 --> 00:03:19.000
So that's an overview of the
lighting

00:03:19.000 --> 00:03:25.420
and how we'll use electricity here
at Escuelita de la Tierra.

00:03:25.420 --> 00:03:30.000
We also need lights inside the
storage room

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:36.420
to illuminate the area and keep the
inverter and batteries secure.

00:03:36.420 --> 00:03:39.420
Thank you very much.

00:03:40.420 --> 00:03:42.420
Thank you so much. friends!

00:03:42.420 --> 00:03:43.700
See you soon!

